ts, engineers and learners interested in experimental technologies and open knowledge. Radiona operates as a hybrid platform that includes a makerspace and hackerspace, a media art laboratory, a Repair Café initiative and an artist-in-residence program . Through workshops, exhibitions, research projects, residencies and public events, Radiona encourages learning by doing and supports DIY, DIWO (Do-It-With-Others) and DITO (Do-It-Together) cultures. In addition to its experimental art and technology programs, Radiona develops inclusive design and assistive technology initiatives through InkluLAB , a program dedicated to accessibility, inclusive education and the collaborative development of tools and technologies for people with disabilities. Radiona is particularly recognised for its work in creative electronics, synthesizer culture, open hardware, experimental instruments, digital fabrication and hybrid art practices that connect artistic exploration with technological experimentation. Education and knowledge-sharing are central to Radiona’s mission. Through workshops, residencies, community programs, InkluLAB activities and its Repair Café initiative, the organisation promotes informal and intergenerational learning through STEAM approaches, accessible technologies and community-driven initiatives. By combining art, technology, open knowledge and collaborative culture, Radiona acts as a platform for experimentation, knowledge exchange and community building within the broader European ecosystem of independent art-tech laboratories . – Radiona: https://radiona.org/ – Social inclusion and cohesion lab – InkluLAB – https://inklulab.eu/ – International maker camp: Electric Wonderland – https://www.electric- wonderland.eu/ – Web portal for green cultures: https://greenoteka.eu/ – Hacktonauts: https://hacktonauts.net/', 'Sources/Raw/radiona/page-1085-about-radiona.md', 'radiona', 'https://radiona.org/about/about-radiona/');
INSERT INTO source_chunks(id, title, url, source_family, path, body, description) VALUES (211, 'Awards', 'https://radiona.org/about/awards/', 'radiona', 'Sources/Raw/radiona/page-10967-awards.md', '# Awards 2025 – The Main prize of the Festival for installation Objects and connotations and Audience Choice Award for installation RotoMotoMuzik @ Festival of the First – Relentless Freedom Penguin Award @ DORS/CLUC 2025 – Croatian Linux Users’ Conference 2016 Synthomir synthesizer – special mention in the category of product design – professional selection by Croatian […] 2025 – The Main prize of the Festival for installation Objects and connotations and Audience Choice Award for installation RotoMotoMuzik @ Festival of the First – Relentless Freedom Penguin Award @ DORS/CLUC 2025 – Croatian Linux Users’ Conference 2016 Synthomir synthesizer – special mention in the category of product design – professional selection by Croatian design professionals within the competition of the Croatian Biennial Design Exhibition', '# Awards 2025 – The Main prize of the Festival for installation Objects and connotations and Audience Choice Award for installation RotoMotoMuzik @ Festival of the First – Relentless Freedom Penguin Award @ DORS/CLUC 2025 – Croatian Linux Users’ Conference 2016 Synthomir synthesizer – special mention in the category of product design – professional selection by Croatian […] 2025 – The Main prize of the Festival for installation Objects and connotations and Audience Choice Award for installation RotoMotoMuzik @ Festival of the First – Relentless Freedom Penguin Award @ DORS/CLUC 2025 – Croatian Linux Users’ Conference 2016 Synthomir synthesizer – special mention in the category of product design – professional selection by Croatian design professionals within the competition of the Croatian Biennial Design Exhibition');
INSERT INTO source_chunks_fts(title, body, path, source_family, url) VALUES ('Awards', '# Awards 2025 – The Main prize of the Festival for installation Objects and connotations and Audience Choice Award for installation RotoMotoMuzik @ Festival of the First – Relentless Freedom Penguin Award @ DORS/CLUC 2025 – Croatian Linux Users’ Conference 2016 Synthomir synthesizer – special mention in the category of product design – professional selection by Croatian […] 2025 – The Main prize of the Festival for installation Objects and connotations and Audience Choice Award for installation RotoMotoMuzik @ Festival of the First – Relentless Freedom Penguin Award @ DORS/CLUC 2025 – Croatian Linux Users’ Conference 2016 Synthomir synthesizer – special mention in the category of product design – professional selection by Croatian design professionals within the competition of the Croatian Biennial Design Exhibition', 'Sources/Raw/radiona/page-10967-awards.md', 'radiona', 'https://radiona.org/about/awards/');
INSERT INTO source_chunks(id, title, url, source_family, path, body, description) VALUES (212, 'Partners / Collaborators', 'https://radiona.org/about/partners/', 'radiona', 'Sources/Raw/radiona/page-1108-partners-collaborators.md', '# Partners / Collaborators International partners / Međunarodni partneri: Hackteria (international network) | SGMK – Swiss Mechatronic Art Society (Switzerland) | Chester Beatty Library (Ireland) | Cap Sciences (France) | Steps (Italy) | Heritec Limited (UK) | Dédale (France) | Michael Culture (Belgium) | Suomen museoliitto (Finland) | Ars Electronica Linz (Austria) | The Regional Museum of Skåne (Sweden) […] International partners / Međunarodni partneri: Hackteria (international network) | SGMK – Swiss Mechatronic Art Society (Switzerland) | Chester Beatty Library (Ireland) | Cap Sciences (France) | Steps (Italy) | Heritec Limited (UK) | Dédale (France) | Michael Culture (Belgium) | Suomen museoliitto (Finland) | Ars Electronica Linz (Austria) | The Regional Museum of Skåne (Sweden) | Museum of Copenhagen (Denmark) | Hungarian Open Air Museum (Hungary) | Creative Museum (Latvia) | BAM! Strategie Culturali (Italy) | Projekt Atol Institute (Slovenia) | SCHMIEDE HALLEIN – Verein zur Förderung der digitalen Kultur (Austria) | Bioart Society (Finland) | Cultivamos Cultura (Portugal) | AudioVisual Arts Department – Ionian University (Greece) | Culture Yard (Denmark) | Catch – Helsingør Kommune (Denmark) | Makery – Art2M, Digital Art International (France) | IBCAN (Italy) | Mz. Baltazar’s Laboratory (Austria) | Museums of the South Troendelag – MiST (Norway) | MuseoMix (France) | Ljudmila – Ljubljana Digital Media Lab (Slovenia) | TU – Technology University – School of Electrical & Electronic Engineering (Ireland) | IRNAS Institute (Slovenia) | SAMA – Street Art Museum Amsterdam (The Netherlands) | Mocca Expertisenetwerk Cultuureducatie (The Netherlands) | TOG Hackerspace (Ireland) | The Festival of Curiosities (Ireland) | Association ‘Mejker’