e slične aktivnosti glazbu ispreplete s raznim vidovima umjetnosti i znanosti te da se u Zadar dovede udruge, organizacije i pojedince koji će potaknuti i inspirirati krajnje korisnike programa, a sve to ususret glazbenim programima koje Koncertni ured Zadar organizira tijekom Koncertne sezone, i uz podršku i suradnju lokalnih kulturnih i obrazovnih ustanova. Naziv projekta Kulturvator nastao je igrom riječi kultura i kultivator odnosno kultivirati što bi u kontekstu projekta značilo sudjelovati u kulturnom životu svoje okoline, kao i izgradnja vlastitog identiteta pojedinca kroz primanje i obradu novih saznanja, razmjenu mišljenja, osjećaja i iskustava.', 'Sources/Raw/radiona/post-10924-theremin-postcard-radionica-kulturvator-u-zadru.md', 'radiona', 'https://radiona.org/theremin-postcard-radionica-kulturvator-u-zadru/');
INSERT INTO source_chunks(id, title, url, source_family, path, body, description) VALUES (271, 'Radiona.org eBadgeLAB and Neo-retro Corner II @ Deep Conference 2025', 'https://radiona.org/radiona-org-ebadgelab-and-neo-retro-corner-ii-deep-conference-2025/', 'radiona', 'Sources/Raw/radiona/post-10928-radiona-org-ebadgelab-and-neo-retro-corner-ii-deep-conference-2025.md', '# Radiona.org eBadgeLAB and Neo-retro Corner II @ Deep Conference 2025 Radiona will host eBadge Workshop LAB and Neo-retro Corner II during the international Deep Conference 2025 which will took place from 22 to 23 October 2025 in Petrčane near Zadar in the coastal part of Croatia. Goran Mahovlić, Tomislava Borić and Deborah Hustić will be in charge for Radiona activities during the program. Goran Mahovlić designed a special […] Radiona will host eBadge Workshop LAB and Neo-retro Corner II during the international Deep Conference 2025 which will took place from 22 to 23 October 2025 in Petrčane near Zadar in the coastal part of Croatia. Goran Mahovlić, Tomislava Borić and Deborah Hustić will be in charge for Radiona activities during the program. Goran Mahovlić designed a special edition of eBadge for this year’s Deep Conference which will participants be able to make and solder during the event. The DEEP Conference is a leading conference in the field of digital ethics, privacy, and security. This event brings together researchers, policymakers, industry professionals, and activists to discuss the ethical and societal implications of digital technologies. The conference covers a wide range of topics, including data privacy, algorithmic bias, cybersecurity policy, and online activism. Attendees can expect keynote speeches, panel discussions, interactive workshops, and networking opportunities. More info here: https://deep-conference.com/', '# Radiona.org eBadgeLAB and Neo-retro Corner II @ Deep Conference 2025 Radiona will host eBadge Workshop LAB and Neo-retro Corner II during the international Deep Conference 2025 which will took place from 22 to 23 October 2025 in Petrčane near Zadar in the coastal part of Croatia. Goran Mahovlić, Tomislava Borić and Deborah Hustić will be in charge for Radiona activities during the program. Goran Mahovlić designed a special […] Radiona will host eBadge Workshop LAB and Neo-retro Corner II during the international Deep Conference 2025 which will took place from 22 to 23 October 2025 in Petrčane near Zadar in the coastal part of Croatia. Goran Mahovlić, Tomislava Borić and Deborah Hustić will be in charge for Radiona activities during the program. Goran Mahovlić designed a special edition of eBadge for this year’s Deep Conference which will participants be able to make and solder during t');
INSERT INTO source_chunks_fts(title, body, path, source_family, url) VALUES ('Radiona.org eBadgeLAB and Neo-retro Corner II @ Deep Conference 2025', '# Radiona.org eBadgeLAB and Neo-retro Corner II @ Deep Conference 2025 Radiona will host eBadge Workshop LAB and Neo-retro Corner II during the international Deep Conference 2025 which will took place from 22 to 23 October 2025 in Petrčane near Zadar in the coastal part of Croatia. Goran Mahovlić, Tomislava Borić and Deborah Hustić will be in charge for Radiona activities during the program. Goran Mahovlić designed a special […] Radiona will host eBadge Workshop LAB and Neo-retro Corner II during the international Deep Conference 2025 which will took place from 22 to 23 October 2025 in Petrčane near Zadar in the coastal part of Croatia. Goran Mahovlić, Tomislava Borić and Deborah Hustić will be in charge for Radiona activities during the program. Goran Mahovlić designed a special edition of eBadge for this year’s Deep Conference which will participants be able to make and solder during the event. The DEEP Conference is a leading conference in the field of digital ethics, privacy, and security. This event brings together researchers, policymakers, industry professionals, and activists to discuss the ethical and societal implications of digital technologies. The conference covers a wide range of topics, including data privacy, algorithmic bias, cybersecurity policy, and online activism. Attendees can expect keynote speeches, panel discussions, interactive workshops, and networking opportunities. More info here: https://deep-conference.com/', 'Sources/Raw/radiona/post-10928-radiona-org-ebadgelab-and-neo-retro-corner-ii-deep-conference-2025.md', 'radiona', 'https://radiona.org/radiona-org-ebadgelab-and-neo-retro-corner-ii-deep-conference-2025/');
INSERT INTO source_chunks(id, title, url, source_family, path, body, description) VALUES (272, 'My Sporting Heritage – Pedagogical Tools: Escape and Geocaching games', 'https://radiona.org/my-sporting-heritage-pedagogical-tools-escape-and-geocaching-games/', 'radiona', 'Sources/Raw/radiona/post-10934-my-sporting-heritage-pedagogical-tools-escape-and-geocaching-games.md', '# My Sporting Heritage – Pedagogical Tools: Escape and Geocaching games We have created two games as a part of the Erasmus+ My Sporting Heritage project. Escape game – The Rift and Geocaching Game – The Sport Heritage Trails. More here: https://my-sporting-heritage.eu/pedagogical-tools We will explore more in the following months the connections between sport, heritage, gamification, creativity and innovation. The Escape game in this phase was […] We have created two games as a part of the Erasmus+ My Sporting Heritage project. Escape game – The Rift and Geocaching Game – The Sport Heritage Trails. More here: https://my-sporting-heritage.eu/pedagogical-tools We will explore more in the following months the connections between sport, heritage, gamification, creativity and innovation. The Escape game in this phase was made by: Deborah Hustić, Damir Prizmić @radiona_org and Laurene Bertrand @museenationaldusport The Geocaching Game was made by: Deborah Hustić, Damir Prizmić (Radiona.org) and Nicolas Mangiapan (Musée National du Sport – Nice). We will continue to update games according to further inputs and playability. This project relies on the expertise of European researchers @uva_amsterdam @ecros_off @sportandcitizen and specialists in digital pedagogy and the sport field (Musée National du Sport, Michael Culture and Radiona). The My Sporting Heritage project, funded by the European Union within the Erasmus+ Sport programme, aims to contribute to the identification, preservation and promotion of a European sporting heritage, that is often under-exposed. This project relies on the expertise of European researchers ( University of Amsterdam – UVA , European Cultural Route of Sport Association , Think Tank Sport & Citoyenneté ) and specialists in digital pedagogy and the sport field ( Musée National du Sport , Michael Culture and Radiona.org ).', '# My Sporting Heritage – Pedagogical Tools: Escape and Geocaching games We have created two games as a part of the Erasmus+ My Sporting Heritage project. Escape game – The Rift and Geocaching Game – The Sport Heritage Trails. More here: https://my-sporting-heritage.eu/pedagogical-tools We will explore more in the following months the connections between sport, heritage, gamification, creativity and innovation. The Escape game in this phase was […] We have created two games as a part of the Erasmus+ My Sporting Heritage project. Escape game – The Rift and Geocaching Game – The Sport Heritage Trails. More here: https://my-sporting-heritage.eu/pedagogical-tools We will explore more in the following months the connections between sport, heritage, gamification, creativity and innovation. The Escape game in this phase was made by: Deborah Hustić, Damir Prizmić @radiona_org and Laurene Bertrand');
INSERT INTO source_chunks_fts(title, body, path, source_family, url) VALUES ('My Sporting Heritage – Pedagogical Tools: Escape and Geocaching games', '# My Sporting Heritage – Pedagogical Tools: Escape and Geocaching games We have created two games as a part of the Erasmus+ My Sporting Heritage project. Escape game – The Rift and Geocaching Game – The Sport Heritage Trails. More here: https://my-sporting-heritage.eu/pedagogical-tools We will explore more in the following months the connections between sport, heritage, gamification, creativity and innovation. The Escape game in this phase was […] We have created two games as a part of the Erasmus+ My Sporting Heritage project. Escape game – The Rift and Geocaching Game – The Sport Heritage Trails. More here: https://my-sporting-heritage.eu/pedagogical-tools We will explore more in the following months the connections between sport, heritage, gamification, creativity and innovation. The Escape game in this phase was made by: Deborah Hustić, Damir Prizmić @radiona_org and Laurene Bertrand @museenationaldusport The Geocaching Game was made by: Deborah Hustić, Damir Prizmić (Radiona.org) and Nicolas Mangiapan (Musée National du Sport – Nice). We will continue to update games according to further inputs and playability. This project relies on the expertise of European researchers @uva_amsterdam @ecros_off @sportandcitizen and specialists in digital pedagogy and the sport field (Musée National du Sport, Michael Culture and Radiona). The My Sporting Heritage project, funded by the European Union within the Erasmus+ Sport programme, aims to contribute to the identification, preservation and promotion of a European sporting heritage, that is often under-exposed. This project relies on the expertise of European researchers ( University of Amsterdam – UVA , European Cultural Route of Sport Association , Think Tank Sport & Citoyenneté ) and specialists in digital pedagogy and the sport field ( Musée National du Sport , Michael Culture and Radiona.org ).', 'Sources/Raw/radiona/post-10934-my-sporting-heritage-pedagogical-tools-escape-and-geocaching-games.md', 'radiona', 'https://radiona.org/my-sporting-heritage-pedagogical-tools-escape-and-geocaching-games/');
INSERT INTO source_chunks(id, title, url, source_family, path, body, description) VALUES (273, 'International Repair Day 2025 @ Radiona', 'https://radiona.org/international-repair-day-2025-radiona/', 'radiona', 'Sources/Raw/radiona/post-10937-international-repair-day-2025-radiona.md', '# International Repair Day 2025 @ Radiona We will mark International Repair Day on Saturday, 18th October from 2pm ongoing in Radiona. We are planning repairing some of the retro devices from our collection, such as computers, cassette players, robots and similar devices. It is an open day for visitors. We will mark International Repair Day on Saturday, 18th October from 2pm ongoing in Radiona. We are planning repairing some of the retro devices from our collection, such as computers, cassette players, robots and similar devices. It is an open day for visitors.', '# International Repair Day 2025 @ Radiona We will mark International Repair Day on Saturday, 18th October from 2pm ongoing in Radiona. We are planning repairing some of the retro devices from our collection, such as computers, cassette players, robots and similar devices. It is an open day for visitors. We will mark International Repair Day on Saturday, 18th October from 2pm ongoing in Radiona. We are planning repairing some of the retro devices from our collection, such as computers, cassette players, robots and similar devices. It is an open day for visitors.');
INSERT INTO source_chunks_fts(title, body, path, source_family, url) VALUES ('International Repair Day 2025 @ Radiona', '# International Repair Day 2025 @ Radiona We will mark International Repair Day on Saturday, 18th October from 2pm ongoing in Radiona. We are planning repairing some of the retro devices from our collection, such as computers, cassette players, robots and similar devices. It is an open day for visitors. We will mark International Repair Day on Saturday, 18th October from 2pm ongoing in Radiona. We are planning repairing some of the retro devices from our collection, such as computers, cassette players, robots and similar devices. It is an open day for visitors.', 'Sources/Raw/radiona/post-10937-international-repair-day-2025-radiona.md', 'radiona', 'https://radiona.org/international-repair-day-2025-radiona/');
INSERT INTO source_chunks(id, title, url, source_family, path, body, description) VALUES (274, 'Radiona.org @ Festival prvih 2025.: Kratki spoj – Tehnologija i vizije budućnosti', 'https://radiona.org/radiona-org-festival-prvih-2025-kratki-spoj-tehnologija-i-vizije-buducnosti/', 'radiona', 'Sources/Raw/radiona/post-10942-radiona-org-festival-prvih-2025-kratki-spoj-tehnologija-i-vizije-budućnosti.md', '# Radiona.org @ Festival prvih 2025.: Kratki spoj – Tehnologija i vizije budućnosti Radiona.org sudjeluje u sklopu programa Festivala prvih 2025. koji se održava pod temom Kratki spoj – Tehnologija i vizije budućnosti od 3. do 11. studenoga 2025. u KIC-u i KNAP-u. Radiona.org sudjeluje radovima svojih članova koji su se u nekom segmentu prvi puta izrazili kroz određene vrstu tehnologije, instalaciju ili u sklopu programa udruge. U […] Radiona.org sudjeluje u sklopu programa Festivala prvih 2025. koji se održava pod temom Kratki spoj – Tehnologija i vizije budućnosti od 3. do 11. studenoga 2025. u KIC-u i KNAP-u. Radiona.org sudjeluje radovima svojih članova koji su se u nekom segmentu prvi puta izrazili kroz određene vrstu tehnologije, instalaciju ili u sklopu programa udruge. U sklopu Izložbe prvih u Galeriji Događanja, KNAP izlažu Sandra Maglov, Lea Kuna (i suradnici/e, Goran Mahovlić, Paula Bučar, Zvonimir Domazet, Deborah Hustić, Igor Brkić, Mario Pavlić), dok u sklopu izložbe Izložbe drugih izlažu Mario Pavlić, Davor Jadrijević i Damir Prizmić. Na javnom razgovoru pod nazivom Uradi sama, Vlaga, Mraz i Sol i tehnologija otvorenog koda sudjeluje Deborah Hustić zajedno s umjetnicima koji sudjeluju na Festivalu. Festival prvih, multidisciplinarni je umjetnički festival, koji se održava dvadeset i pet godina u Zagrebu. Festival prvih pokrenuo je multimedijalni umjetnik Željko Zorica (1957. – 2013.) postavivši ga kao smotru dostignuća stvaratelja različitih umjetničkih i neumjetničkih profila. FP svake godine proglašava središnju temu. Dosadašnje teme bile su: reklamokracija, GMO i biotehnologije, dominacije, mine, društvena odgovornost kapitala, mediji i prava djeteta, besplatno obrazovanje, poslovi sa Suncem, nepoznata mjesta u hrvatskoj umjetnosti 70-ih i 80-ih, nada, društvo razočaranja, depresija, solidarnost, pravo na (po)grešku, izmišljanje tradicije, doba praznine, nestalna ljubav – o krhkosti ljudskih odnosa, potreba za stanom i stambena politika, usamljenost i socijalna izolacija, te vrijeme rizika – nesigurnost kao konstanta, (ne) vidljive žene, gubitak/tugovanje i Kratki spoj – Tehnologija i vizije budućnosti. Detaljnije: https://www.studio-artless.hr/', '# Radiona.org @ Festival prvih 2025.: Kratki spoj – Tehnologija i vizije budućnosti Radiona.org sudjeluje u sklopu programa Festivala prvih 2025. koji se održava pod temom Kratki spoj – Tehnologija i vizije budućnosti od 3. do 11. studenoga 2025. u KIC-u i KNAP-u. Radiona.org sudjeluje radovima svojih članova koji su se u nekom segmentu prvi puta izrazili kroz određene vrstu tehnologije, instalaciju ili u sklopu programa udruge. U […] Radiona.org sudjeluje u sklopu programa Festivala prvih 2025. koji se održava pod temom Kratki spoj – Tehnologija i vizije budućnosti od 3. do 11. studenoga 2025. u KIC-u i KNAP-u. Radiona.org sudjeluje radovima svojih članova koji su se u nekom segmentu prvi puta izrazili kroz određene vrstu tehnologije, instalaciju ili u sklopu programa udruge. U sklopu Izložbe prvih u Galeriji Događanja, KNAP izlažu Sandra Maglov, Lea Kuna (i suradnici/e, Goran Mahovlić,');
