 were created – one competitive, and the other as a reserve. This will be Radiona’s first competition at Fightbotics because previously our lab did not want to participate due to a potential conflict of interest – hosting preparatory workshops for students took place in our space and the main mentor for the fights was our member and associate Vedran Relja. Since in the last two years preparatory education and mentoring have been taking place within the student population and the space of FSB and FER, Radiona decided to start participating in the competition in 2025. Fightbotics se pod ovim nazivom održava od 2022. godine, a kroz prethodna izdanja privukao je brojne sudionike i publiku zainteresiranu za robotiku i tehničke izazove. Tijekom ove godine borbe robota održane su i u sklopu Green River Festivala te Geek Games konvencije u Velikoj Gorici. Natjecanja su posljednjih godina imala visoku posjećenost; primjerice, izdanje održano 2023. u Močvari bilo je rasprodano nekoliko dana prije događaja. Među publikom su zastupljene sve dobne skupine, dok se među natjecateljima ističu studentski timovi i hobističke ekipe. Studentskim timovima organizatori omogućuju sufinanciranje troškova izrade te pristup prostoru i alatu u Studentskom inovacijskom centru Fakulteta strojarstva i brodogradnje, dok ostali timovi troškove snose samostalno. Fightbotics has been held under this name since 2022, and through previous editions it has attracted numerous participants and an audience interested in robotics and technical challenges. During this year, robot fights were also held as part of the Green River Festival and the Geek Games convention in Velika Gorica. The competitions have had a high attendance in recent years; for example, the 2023 edition held in Močvara was sold out a few days before the event. All age groups are represented among the audience, while student teams and hobby teams stand out among the competitors. The organizers provide student teams with co-financing for the production costs and access to space and tools at the Student Innovation Center of the Faculty of Mechanical Engineering and Naval Architecture, while other teams cover the costs independently. Detaljnije / More: https://fightbotics.com/', 'Sources/Raw/radiona/post-11033-radiona-org-fightbotics-2025.md', 'radiona', 'https://radiona.org/radiona-org-fightbotics-2025/');
