s a showcase of neo and retro technologies from Radiona’s device collection. BSides Zagreb 2026 is a community-focused security conference, created for researchers, professionals, and enthusiasts who want a welcoming place to learn and collaborate. The event brings people together to share ideas, explore new security topics, and connect with others who care about open knowledge in cybersecurity. Since the conference is entirely volunteer-based and non-profit, it maintains a relaxed and supportive atmosphere where visitors can participate in talks, workshops, and discussions led by the local and regional security community.', 'Sources/Raw/radiona/post-11247-ebadge-zigzag-i-neoretro-corner-bsides-zagreb-2026.md', 'radiona', 'https://radiona.org/ebadge-zigzag-i-neoretro-corner-bsides-zagreb-2026/');
INSERT INTO source_chunks(id, title, url, source_family, path, body, description) VALUES (297, 'Mindfulness sesija gerilskog heklanja by Mogut / Mindfulness guerrilla crocheting session by Mogut', 'https://radiona.org/mindfulness-sesija-gerilskog-heklanja-by-mogut-mindfulness-guerrilla-crocheting-session-by-mogut/', 'radiona', 'Sources/Raw/radiona/post-11251-mindfulness-sesija-gerilskog-heklanja-by-mogut-mindfulness-guerrilla-crocheting-session-by.md', '# Mindfulness sesija gerilskog heklanja by Mogut / Mindfulness guerrilla crocheting session by Mogut U ponedjeljak, 3. ožujka 2026. s početkom u 19h nastavljamo sa Mindfulness sesijom gerilskog heklanja pod vodstvom Tajane Vidojević poznatije pod umjetničkim imenom Mogut – Guardian of Heritage. For English please scroll down. Ako do sada niste sudjelovali, a htjeli bi doći, šibnite na e-mail na radiona.org@gmail.com Grupa okuplja hardver hakere, programere, makere, dizajnere, ilustratore i […] U ponedjeljak, 3. ožujka 2026. s početkom u 19h nastavljamo sa Mindfulness sesijom gerilskog heklanja pod vodstvom Tajane Vidojević poznatije pod umjetničkim imenom Mogut – Guardian of Heritage . For English please scroll down. Ako do sada niste sudjelovali, a htjeli bi doći, šibnite na e-mail na radiona.org@gmail.com Grupa okuplja hardver hakere, programere, makere, dizajnere, ilustratore i sve koji se žele izraziti iglom i vunom s ciljem smirivanja živaca, jačanja fokusa i generalno kolektivnog zezanja uz solidan humor. ///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////// On Monday, March 3, 2026, starting at 7 p.m., we continue with the Mindfulness session of guerilla crochet led by Tajana Vidojević, better known by the stage name Mogut – Guardian of Heritage. If you haven’t participated so far and would like to come, send us e-mail to radiona.org@gmail.com The group gathers hardware hackers, programmers, makers, designers, illustrators and everyone who wants to express themselves with a needle and wool with the aim of calming nerves, strengthening focus and general collective banter with solid humor.', '# Mindfulness sesija gerilskog heklanja by Mogut / Mindfulness guerrilla crocheting session by Mogut U ponedjeljak, 3. ožujka 2026. s početkom u 19h nastavljamo sa Mindfulness sesijom gerilskog heklanja pod vodstvom Tajane Vidojević poznatije pod umjetničkim imenom Mogut – Guardian of Heritage. For English please scroll down. Ako do sada niste sudjelovali, a htjeli bi doći, šibnite na e-mail na radiona.org@gmail.com Grupa okuplja hardver hakere, programere, makere, dizajnere, ilustratore i […] U ponedjeljak, 3. ožujka 2026. s početkom u 19h nastavljamo sa Mindfulness sesijom gerilskog heklanja pod vodstvom Tajane Vidojević poznatije pod umjetničkim imenom Mogut – Guardian of Heritage . For English please scroll down. Ako do sada niste sudjelovali, a htjeli bi doći, šibnite na e-mail na radiona.org@gmail.com Grupa okuplja hardver hakere, programere, makere, dizajnere, ilustratore i sve ko');
