Central Coast. In her practice, she hand-carves wood and linoleum blocks to create prints with rich textures and striking graphic elements. With a strong focus on colour, she explores a wide range of combinations using high-quality professional oil-based inks, often incorporating chine-collé to add depth and layered complexity. Each print is hand-pulled on carefully selected artist-grade paper, resulting in a distinctive and unique work of art. IG profil: https://www.instagram.com/lisiprints Supported by: City of Zagreb // Ministry of Culture and Media of the Republic of Croatia // Kultura Nova Foundation', 'Sources/Raw/radiona/post-11419-otisak-kao-proces-radionica-linoreza-i-eksperimentalne-grafike.md', 'radiona', 'https://radiona.org/otisak-kao-proces-radionica-linoreza-i-eksperimentalne-grafike/');
