hinery... they want a nice and handy device for the hand luggage 2. analog video delay on a huge rotating disk and of course there is 24 hour FLozki Care during the forschungswoche: eso-tronic devices that means FREE and experimental treatment for all your bobos and health problems. i bring some eso-tronic devices like acupuncture synth - hemmisphere sync generators - violet wand - homemade x-ray machinery........ so enjoy also the spa side of anyma atelier. metal evaporation coating machine an option if there is enough interest:as a forschungswoche project we might can do together: i can bring my BALZERS vacuum coating machine and we bring it into working order. i have all even a nice and fast turbo molecular pump. just need to hook up everything . plug it in and coat whatever we want. all smaller than 20cm diameter. Uwe & Jördis stuff [ edit ] we continue our Lunetta style CMOS synth & sequencer stuff https://docs.google.com/document/d/1V9qerry_PsXTZqt_UDx7C-wcuMe_6_gyy6M_MyAgQoA/edit what''s your project? [ edit ] Nice to have [ edit ] Flo brings a metal evaporation machine. just some fixing on the pump would help... http://www.slideshare.net/dusjagr/mis-lecture-microfabprocesses-36441370/13 Some random notes [ edit ] Programming the Attiny13A [ edit ] https://github.com/tekstop/attiny/tree/Arduino1 Join the IRC channel [ edit ] http://webchat.freenode.net?channels=%23Forschungswoche2015&uio=d4 <iframe src=" http://webchat.freenode.net?channels=%23Forschungswoche2015&uio=d4 " width="647" height="400"></iframe> Good old times... [ edit ] https://vimeo.com/channels/forschungswoche2011 {{#widget:Vimeo|id=24680574}}', 'Sources/Raw/sgmk/anyma-2015.md', 'sgmk', 'https://wiki.sgmk-ssam.ch/wiki/ANYMA_2015');
