26 : tbd [ edit ] related: a.n.y.m.a Forschungswoche [ edit ] anyma 2011, Makers Interview: https://vimeo.com/24680574 Vimeo channel 2011: https://vimeo.com/channels/forschungswoche2011 2011 Album by dusjagr: https://www.flickr.com/photos/dusjagr/albums/72157626763782585/ International Influences [ edit ]', 'Sources/Raw/sgmk/archive-home-made.md', 'sgmk', 'https://wiki.sgmk-ssam.ch/wiki/Archive_HOME_MADE');
