INSERT INTO source_chunks(id, title, url, source_family, path, body, description) VALUES (338, 'HOME MADE 2016', 'https://wiki.sgmk-ssam.ch/wiki/HOME_MADE_2016', 'sgmk', 'Sources/Raw/sgmk/home-made-2016.md', '# HOME MADE 2016 Contents 1 About 2 First days Impressions 3 Date 4 Venue 5 Fee 6 Registration 7 Directions 8 Workshops 9 Program 10 Contact Persons 11 Participants 12 Documentation Projects Homemade 2016 About [ edit ] As always the summercamp is 1 week , 24h/day : DIY, fun, solder, jam, cook, learn, swim, perform, eat, sleep, talk, hack, tan, drink, experiment, party, work, relax definitely the shortest week of the year! But Homemade 2016 is special. The SGMK is celebrating 10 years of soldering. The participants are invited to take part in the preparation of the 10 years SGMK anniversary festival that will happen just after the Homemade week in Zuerich. The participants can present their projects of the homemade week at this festival. First days Impressions [ edit ] Iiäätzete! First thing: setting up the etching station.. ..and start geeking around Schönwetter Arbeitsplätze Ken macht Faltkunst Küchen-Crew Uwe spielt mit dem "Music on a long thin Wire" Setting up the 3D printer, first experiments with snail-printing Nukular Workshop mit Ralf Schreiber''s "Gamma Detektor und Pechblende" Claude pluggin in the "Ischmir crazy Modular Shit" Gut haben wir ein Dack gebaut. Gelegentliche Regenschauer Erste Grill-Session! Date [ edit ] 22.7. (12:00) - 29.7.2016 (12:00) Homemade summercamp 29.7. - 31.7.2016 SGMK aniversary festival: Festival der Mechatronischen Künste direct link: http://festival.mechatronicart.ch Venue [ edit ] Pfadiheim Weierholz Weierholzstrasse 8330 Pfäffikon ZH Switzerland Weierholz And some pictures: Fee [ edit ] SGMK Members CHF 295.- non SGMK Members CHF 345.- the fee includes food, accommodation and basic material Registration [ edit ] mail to homemade@sgmk-ssam.ch Directions [ edit ] Deutsch : Zug S3 von Zürich HB nach Pfäffikon ZH Bahnhof Pfäffikon ZH 10 min zu Fuss English : Train S3 from Zuerich HB (Mainstation) to Pfaeffikon ZH Railwaystation Pfaeffikon ZH 10 min walk Workshops [ edit ] Ideen für Workshops, die du durchführen möchtest, oder an welchen du gerne teilnehmen möchtest, kannst du auf folgender Website besprechen: Openki.net Schaue, ob der Workshop bereits vorhanden ist. Falls nicht, kannst du ihn gleich selbst erstellen . Openki ist eine opensource Plattform, um Workshops zu organisieren. Es wäre super, wenn wir mit dem HomeMade die Beta-Version testen helfen, um die Plattform zu verbessern. Die Entwickler werden an einigen Tagen der Woche selber anwesend sein. Mehr Infos zum Projekt findet ihr hier: about.openki.net Program [ edit ] Sign in/up and announce or request your performance / collaboration / proposals here Zusammenarbeit und Projekte für das anschliessende Festival der SGMK sind sehr erwünscht! Chris Vernon #1; Tesla''s time machine. Noise. Sparks. Chris Vernon #2; Digital audio amplifier for plasma modulation. Music. Fire. RF burns. Chris Vernon #3; (On request) Delta Sigma modulators and z-transforms (if anyone is interested) Chris Vernon #4; (collaboration/group activity) build a digital induction radio system Contact Persons [ edit ] Oliver Jaeggi: Organisation, SGMK core team Uwe Schueler: technical direction / veteran ( Workshops, tech. lectures, DIY kits ) Adam Donovan: artistic direction Claude Treptow: artistic direction Participants [ edit ] HOME MADE 2016 Participants Documentation Projects Homemade 2016 [ edit ] File:DSCN6365.JPG This is the 2016 version of the Tesla Alarm Clock File:detail.JPG Where it all started in 2013; Tesla fire alarm latch-up simulator', '# HOME MADE 2016 Contents 1 About 2 First days Impressions 3 Date 4 Venue 5 Fee 6 Registration 7 Directions 8 Workshops 9 Program 10 Contact Persons 11 Participants 12 Documentation Projects Homemade 2016 About [ edit ] As always the summercamp is 1 week , 24h/day : DIY, fun, solder, jam, cook, learn, swim, perform, eat, sleep, talk, hack, tan, drink, experiment, party, work, relax definitely the shortest week of the year! But Homemade 2016 is special. The SGMK is celebrating 10 years of soldering. The participants are invited to take part in the preparation of the 10 years SGMK anniversary festival that will happen just after the Homemade week in Zuerich. The participants can present their projects of the homemade week at this festival. First days Impressions [ edit ] Iiäätzete! First thing: setting up the etching station.. ..and start geeking around Schönwetter Arbeitsplätze Ken macht ');
